    tch_short: "Free AI tools for teachers",
    tch_doc: "Free AI Tools for Teachers: Worksheets, Quizzes, Prompts (Hindi)",
    tch_desc: "Make worksheets, quizzes, report cards, certificates and better AI prompts for free. No login, no ads, works on a phone or smartboard, in Hindi and 11 more languages.",
    tch_h1: "Free AI tools for teachers: save hours every week",
    tch_lead: "Lesson plans from Gemini or ChatGPT, printable worksheets, class quizzes, report cards and certificates: here is how to do each one for free, in your own language, without giving away student data.",
    tch_quick: "Use {app_prompt_builder} to get better lesson plans and question papers from any free AI chatbot, {app_worksheet_generator} for printable sheets with answer keys, {app_quiz_maker} for class quizzes and WhatsApp practice links, and {app_marks_report_card} for results. All of them are free, need no login and keep your data on your device.",
    tch_steps_h: "A teacher's week with free tools, step by step",
    tch_s1_t: "Plan the lesson with a good AI prompt",
    tch_s1: "Open {app_prompt_builder}, pick a template such as a lesson plan or a question paper, fill in the class, subject and chapter, and press “{pb_copy}”. Paste the prompt into Gemini or ChatGPT. A complete prompt gives a far better answer than a one-line question.",
    tch_s2_t: "Print a maths worksheet with an answer key",
    tch_s2: "In {app_worksheet_generator}, choose one of 19 topics for Classes 1–8, the number of questions and the difficulty. Press “{ws_print}”: the answer key comes on a separate last page, so you can keep it with you.",
