    tch_s6_t: "Check AI answers before you use them",
    tch_s6: "AI chatbots make mistakes in facts, maths and answer keys. Read every answer, compare it with the NCERT book, and never type students' names, marks or phone numbers into an AI chatbot.",
    tch_x_h: "Ready-to-use prompts for teachers",
    tch_x1: "<b>Lesson plan:</b> “You are an experienced Class 7 science teacher. Make a 40-minute lesson plan on [chapter] with a starter activity, two discussion questions and homework. Use Indian examples.”",
    tch_x2: "<b>Question paper:</b> “Make 10 MCQs and 5 short-answer questions on [chapter] for Class [n], CBSE pattern, with the answer key on a separate page.”",
    tch_x3: "<b>Notes:</b> “Explain [topic] in simple Hindi for Class [n] in 10 points, with one real-life example.”",
    tch_x4: "<b>Parent message:</b> “Write a polite WhatsApp message to parents about the parent-teacher meeting on [date], in Hindi and English, under 60 words.”",
    tch_q1: "Are these AI tools for teachers really free?",
    tch_a1: "Yes. AI Pathshala apps are free, with no ads, no login for students and no paid plan. Gemini and ChatGPT also have free versions that are enough for lesson plans and question papers.",
    tch_q2: "Do I need to install anything?",
    tch_a2: "No. The apps open in any browser on a phone, laptop or smartboard. Once you have opened an app, it keeps working without internet.",
    tch_q3: "Is it safe to use with student data?",
    tch_a3: "Our apps keep everything on your device: marks, names and attendance are never uploaded. Do not paste students' names, marks or phone numbers into any AI chatbot.",
    tch_q4: "Which AI chatbot is best for Hindi?",
    tch_a4: "Gemini and ChatGPT both understand Hindi and other Indian languages. Write the prompt in the language you want the answer in, and mention the class and the board (CBSE or state board).",
    tch_q5: "Can AI make a full question paper?",
    tch_a5: "It can make a good first draft. Always check the questions, marks and answer key yourself before you print, because AI sometimes gets answers wrong.",
    tch_card: "Worksheets, quizzes, report cards and better AI prompts, free and in your language.",
    tch_shot1: "Prompt Builder: pick a template, then fill in the class, subject and chapter.",
